{"page":255,"verses":[{"verse_key":"13:43","surah":13,"ayah":43,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لَسْتَ مُرْسَلًا ۚ قُلْ كَفَىٰ بِٱللَّهِ شَهِيدًۢا بَيْنِى وَبَيْنَكُمْ وَمَنْ عِندَهُۥ عِلْمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They say, ‘You have not been sent.’ Say, ‘God is sufficient witness between me and you: all knowledge of the Scripture comes from Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"And say","transliteration":"wayaqūlu","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَسْتَ","en_gloss":"You are not","transliteration":"lasta","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُرْسَلًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"a Messenger","transliteration":"mur'salan","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَفَىٰ","en_gloss":"Sufficient","transliteration":"kafā","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(is) Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شَهِيدًۢا","en_gloss":"(as) a Witness","transliteration":"shahīdan","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَيْنِى","en_gloss":"between me","transliteration":"baynī","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَبَيْنَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and between you","transliteration":"wabaynakum","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عِندَهُۥ","en_gloss":"[he] has","transliteration":"ʿindahu","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عِلْمُ","en_gloss":"knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'mu","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"13:43"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤٣","en_gloss":"(43)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:43"}]},{"verse_key":"14:1","surah":14,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" الٓر ۚ كِتَـٰبٌ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ إِلَيْكَ لِتُخْرِجَ ٱلنَّاسَ مِنَ ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ إِلَى ٱلنُّورِ بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهِمْ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطِ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْحَمِيدِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Alif Lam Ra This is a Scripture which We have sent down to you [Prophet] so that, with their Lord’s permission, you may bring people from the depths of darkness into light, to the path of the Almighty, the Praiseworthy One,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"الٓر ۚ","en_gloss":"Alif Laam Ra","transliteration":"alif-lam-ra","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كِتَـٰبٌ","en_gloss":"A Book","transliteration":"kitābun","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"which We have revealed","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِتُخْرِجَ","en_gloss":"so that you may bring out","transliteration":"litukh'rija","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"the mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the darkness[es]","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلنُّورِ","en_gloss":"the light","transliteration":"l-nūri","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِإِذْنِ","en_gloss":"by the permission","transliteration":"bi-idh'ni","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"(of) their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"صِرَٰطِ","en_gloss":"the Path","transliteration":"ṣirāṭi","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزِ","en_gloss":"(of) the All-Mighty","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzi","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْحَمِيدِ","en_gloss":"the Praiseworthy","transliteration":"l-ḥamīdi","verse_key":"14:1"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:1"}]},{"verse_key":"14:2","surah":14,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ٱلَّذِى لَهُۥ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ وَوَيْلٌ لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ مِنْ عَذَابٍ شَدِيدٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God, to whom everything in the heavens and earth belongs. How terrible will be the torment of those who ignore [Him],","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"al-lahi","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to Him (belongs)","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَوَيْلٌۭ","en_gloss":"And woe","transliteration":"wawaylun","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"to the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَذَابٍۢ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":14,"ar":"شَدِيدٍ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"shadīdin","verse_key":"14:2"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٢","en_gloss":"(2)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:2"}]},{"verse_key":"14:3","surah":14,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَسْتَحِبُّونَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا عَلَى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ وَيَصُدُّونَ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ وَيَبْغُونَهَا عِوَجًا ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ فِى ضَلَـٰلٍۭ بَعِيدٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"those who prefer the life of this world over the life to come, who turn others from God’s way, trying to make it crooked: such people have gone far astray.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْتَحِبُّونَ","en_gloss":"love more","transliteration":"yastaḥibbūna","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayata","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"than","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَيَصُدُّونَ","en_gloss":"and hinder","transliteration":"wayaṣuddūna","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) Path","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَيَبْغُونَهَا","en_gloss":"and seek in it","transliteration":"wayabghūnahā","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عِوَجًا ۚ","en_gloss":"crookedness","transliteration":"ʿiwajan","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"[in]","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ضَلَـٰلٍۭ","en_gloss":"(are) far astray","transliteration":"ḍalālin","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَعِيدٍۢ","en_gloss":"(are) far astray","transliteration":"baʿīdin","verse_key":"14:3"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٣","en_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"14:3"}]},{"verse_key":"14:4","surah":14,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَرْسَلْنَا مِن رَّسُولٍ إِلَّا بِلِسَانِ قَوْمِهِۦ لِيُبَيِّنَ لَهُمْ ۖ فَيُضِلُّ ٱللَّهُ مَن يَشَآءُ وَيَهْدِى مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have never sent a messenger who did not use his own people’s language to make things clear for them. But still God leaves whoever He will to stray, and guides whoever He will: He is the Almighty, the All Wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَّسُولٍ","en_gloss":"Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlin","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِلِسَانِ","en_gloss":"with the language","transliteration":"bilisāni","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَوْمِهِۦ","en_gloss":"(of) his people","transliteration":"qawmihi","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِيُبَيِّنَ","en_gloss":"so that he might make clear","transliteration":"liyubayyina","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَيُضِلُّ","en_gloss":"Then Allah lets go astray","transliteration":"fayuḍillu","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Then Allah lets go astray","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَيَهْدِى","en_gloss":"and guides","transliteration":"wayahdī","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"14:4"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wa